OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start with a few
OL,6,Fpatches of fog possible in places.
OL,7,FOtherwise mostly dry with variable
OL,8,Fcloud and bright or sunny spells. The
OL,9,Fodd shower possible around the east
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry with some clear spells
OL,13,Fand light winds allowing overnight
OL,14,Ffrost to develop in places, as well as
OL,15,Fthe chance of fog. Cloudier around the
OL,16,Feast coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
