OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F179A1794196530
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FAny overnight fog may be
OL,6,Fquite slow to clear. Otherwise dry
OL,7,Fwith bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping. Chance of some frost and
OL,9,Ffog developing again overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FTurning chillier but staying dry and
OL,13,Fsunny on Wednesday and Thursday.
OL,14,FOvernight frost and fog possible under
OL,15,Fclearer skies. Milder with bright
OL,16,Fspells Friday, the odd shower in west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
